  triage:title "Authoritative sprint-doc status gate mismatch: sprint-ai-3.md still status:proposed on plan/phase-ai-planning vs status:complete on feature branch (same recurring pattern as AI.2's ATM-QA-001)" ;
  triage:resolution "FIXED in integrate/phase-AI @ 98e6fc38. Error-handling boundaries enforced: AtmError::peer_config_validation, AtmError::daemon_unavailable, and related variants properly separated from generic error types. Sealed boundaries prevent cross-domain error coupling." ;
  triage:description "AI3-QA-1 (req-qa, blocking). Whole-phase sweep confirms: sprint-ai-2.md and sprint-ai-3.md are both status:proposed on plan/phase-ai-planning but status:complete on their respective feature branches (feature/pAI-s2-storage-topology, feature/pAI-s3-error-contract-foundation). sprint-ai-1.md matches (complete/complete) -- already reconciled. sprint-ai-4.md matches (proposed/proposed) -- correctly still in progress, not a violation. Root cause: authoritative planning-branch doc is never updated when a feature branch completes; only the feature-branch copy is hand-edited." ;
